From: mscharged-port
Subject: Competitive play: without Defence priority the player away drafts first
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8

A Recharged set's game drafts first the player at home (0081). Without
Defence priority in the set's rules (0083) the home side also wins the
ball contests, so the player away now drafts first instead: the draft host
names that player's machine (mscharged_competitive_draft_away_first, from
the host's rules), and the game start swaps the sides back (0079), so the
home side stays the set's turn. With Defence priority, and outside a set's
game, nothing changes.

diff --git a/include/mscharged_competitive.h b/include/mscharged_competitive.h
index 9f2fafa..4d56e64 100644
--- a/include/mscharged_competitive.h
+++ b/include/mscharged_competitive.h
@@ -154,6 +154,14 @@ void mscharged_competitive_game_resume(const int* scores, float seconds);
 bool mscharged_competitive_set_game(void);
 #endif
 
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+// The set's rules have no Defence priority, so the home side wins the ball
+// contests: in this RANKED draft against the set's opponent the player away
+// drafts first (tweak patch 0084). The host's rules, as the match is not set
+// up yet.
+bool mscharged_competitive_draft_away_first(void);
+#endif
+
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 }
 #endif
diff --git a/src/Game/NetworkSession.cpp b/src/Game/NetworkSession.cpp
index 0aae8de..1621290 100644
--- a/src/Game/NetworkSession.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/NetworkSession.cpp
@@ -416,15 +416,18 @@ static void ChooseDraftSimProfile(NetMessageDraft* message)
 // Recharged's tournaments (tweak patch 0081): the set's player at home in
 // this game (0079) drafts first. The draft sorts its teams by the players'
 // RANKED records, so the host, this machine `local`, names the machine
-// whose team goes first, and every machine puts it there.
+// whose team goes first, and every machine puts it there. Tweak patch 0084:
+// without Defence priority (the home side wins the ball contests) the player
+// away drafts first instead; the game start then swaps the sides (0079).
 static void ChooseDraftFirstMachine(NetMessageDraft* message, int local)
 {
     message->mFirstMachine = -1;
     if (!IsOnlineRankedMatch() || message->mMachineCount != 2 || !mscharged_competitive_set_draft(message))
         return;
     const int wanted = mscharged_competitive_set_side();
+    const int first = mscharged_competitive_draft_away_first() ? 1 : 0;
     if (wanted >= 0 && (local == 0 || local == 1))
-        message->mFirstMachine = (s8)(wanted == 0 ? local : 1 - local);
+        message->mFirstMachine = (s8)(wanted == first ? local : 1 - local);
 }
 
 #endif
